  {
    "id": 4001001050450,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……やっぱり、櫻木さんの声、よく通るね",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100105/4001001050450"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001050460,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしも通りやすい方なんだけどな～\r\n真乃の声は、なんていうか、聴き入っちゃう声だよね",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100105/4001001050460"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001050470,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……私、もっと練習しないと……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100105/4001001050470"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001050480,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……はーい、ひとつ改善点を挙げたいです！",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100105/4001001050480"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001050490,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "え。な、何……？\r\n……なんでも、教えてほしい",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100105/4001001050490"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001050500,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "灯織はいろんなことを、\r\n自分だけでどうにかしようと思いすぎだと思います",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100105/4001001050500"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001050510,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100105/4001001050510"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001050520,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "これからずっと３人なんだから、練習だって３人でやろうよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100105/4001001050520"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001050530,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ひとりでやるより、みんなで話し合ったほうが\r\n上手くいくと思うんだ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100105/4001001050530"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001050540,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だって、せっかく同じユニットになれたんだからさ！\r\nそうでしょ？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100105/4001001050540"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001050550,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "八宮さ──",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100105/4001001050550"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001050560,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……ううん。そうだよね、ありがとう",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100105/4001001050560"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001050570,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……めぐる",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100105/4001001050570"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001050580,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "！\r\n……うん",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100105/4001001050580"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001050590,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……来てくれて嬉しかった\r\nおかげで、すっきりした",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100105/4001001050590"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001050600,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100105/4001001050600"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001050610,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "イルミネーションスターズで……\r\nみんなで一緒に輝きたい",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100105/4001001050610"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001050620,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "３人、一緒に……！\r\n１番輝く、アイドルになりたい",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100105/4001001050620"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001050630,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "──もちろん！　わたしたちなら、きっと輝けるよ！\r\nデビューライブ、頑張ろうね！",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
